Generic helper over a closure: Value[T] runs op through Do and smuggles the result out via captured variables.
Only instance: Value[*domain.Account] from Service.Balance, op = store.Get (memory + filerepo Candidates).
Expect NotFoundError[AccountID], filerepo's read errors behind "filerepo: read %s: %w", decode errors behind
(*CorruptError).Unwrap, ctx.Err() origins, and ErrGaveUp behind "%w after %d attempts: %w".
-- args --
-fanout=1 retry/retry.go:@value
